# Every construct, with canonical and non-canonical spelling.
use aws in eu-west-2
use gcp
USE Azure IN "west europe"

database db is postgres 16, small
Database cache is redis 7 and small and internal
bucket uploads is private
queue jobs is fifo
lb edge
Load Balancer web is public
  listen on 443 with tls for api.example.com
  send / to api

service api
  image ghcr.io/me/api:latest
  port 8080
  scale 2 to 10
  env GREETING "hello, world"
  healthcheck
  on aws
    platform_version LATEST
    capacity_provider_strategy
      capacity_provider FARGATE_SPOT
      weight 1
    tags "team: payments"

api connects to db
api reads and writes uploads
api reads uploads
api writes uploads
api sends to jobs
API Connects To DB
queue connects to db
on reads uploads

on aws
  network
    public_subnets subnet-a, subnet-b,subnet-c
  service api sets capacity_provider to FARGATE_SPOT
